# Intentionally empty candidate.
#
# Codex 0.152.0 execpolicy governs commands requested outside the sandbox and
# matches argv prefixes. A small global blacklist was bypassable through valid
# argv shapes such as absolute executable paths, `git -C`, `terraform -chdir`,
# and unsplittable shell wrappers, while broad prompts duplicated ordinary
# sandbox approvals. Stack- and target-specific rules should be introduced only
# where a concrete project or managed requirement can define complete patterns.
